# Apple/iOS-style emoji PNGs - proprietary, local-use-only override for the
# quiz icons (see icons/quiz_emoji_*.png, the CC-BY Twemoji versions, for
# the committed fallback everyone else's clone actually gets).
icons/*_ios.png
